    <div .bs-docs-section.fade-in-box>
            <h2>Write Your Way
            <p>Choose the format that works best for you - math-enhanced Markdown or LaTeX. Whichever you choose, you keep features like cross-referencing, bibliographies, and theorem environments.
            <p>
                <a.btn.btn-default href=@{EditHelpR "editor"}?format=md#editor>Markdown demo
                <a.btn.btn-default href=@{EditHelpR "editor"}?format=tex#editor>LaTeX demo

    <hr>
    <div .bs-docs-section.fade-in-box>
      <h2>More Features
      <div.scroll-box-x>
        <ul.scroll-list-x>
            <li>  
                <div.panel.panel-default>
                  <div.panel-body>
                    <h3>Style-Decoupled Editing
                    <p.text-muted>
                        Keep writing focused on your content
            <li>
                <div.panel.panel-default>
                  <div.panel-body>
                    <h3>PDF Export
                    <p.text-muted>
                        Convert your post into a PDF in just one click
            <li>
                <div.panel.panel-default>
                  <div.panel-body>
                    <h3>Math-Compatible Dark Mode
                    <p.text-muted>
                        Properly adjust mathematical symbol colors in dark mode
            <li>
                <div.panel.panel-default>
                  <div.panel-body>
                    <h3>Lean Syntax Highlighting
                    <p.text-muted>
                        Native syntax support for the Lean theorem prover
            <li>
                <div.panel.panel-default>
                  <div.panel-body>
                    <h3>Minimalist
                    <p.text-muted>
                        No clutter. No distractions. Just a clean, efficient, and secure space for your thoughts
